nce his father  of their use I think there's definitely  some push towards the idea of the  friendship between the king and his  storm Drake as the storm curved sword  relates the nameless King ally of the  ancient dragons  fought beside the storm Drake in  countless battles when the Great Beast  fell the king claimed his soul as was  the custom in the age of gods after a  lifetime of battles the two must have  been close this is truly seen when the  player-character fails the Drake before  claiming his soul a nameless King  caresses the beasts arm in an almost  somber moment hesitating to deliver the  final blow and absorb his soul nameless  king also had some history with  Dragonslayer Ornstein Ornstein was said  to be the first night of the sons eldest  born we now know to be the nameless king  through these similar references of war  God in both the nameless King and  Gwynn's firstborn  additionally the weapon that the name  was gang wields the Dragon Slayer sword  spear is the earliest form of the cross  spear orange Dean's weapon of choice is  a lightning imbued cross spear which he  used during the time of the dragon war  and as such is called the Dragon Slayer  spear so chances are Ornstein spear is a  direct result of the nameless Kings  what's most impactful in Dark Souls 3 in  the story of orange scene and the  nameless King is that orange scenes  armor can be found at the site of the  nameless Kings boss light his helm tells  us what happened in the dragon Lesage so  the current age were now this knight who  long guarded the ruined Cathedral left  the land in search of the nameless King  so Ornstein left his post in Anor Londo  to find his old master there can be  speculation as to why arnt seemed wanted  to see the nameless king he could have  been angry with his Lord for abandoning  his old life and siding with the  dragon's enemies of the gods or perhaps  Ornstein simply wanted to be reunited  with an old friend  finding Orton's armor here can imply  